				},
				{
					"id": 10310602,
					"content": "…來這裡，或許也是有所感悟。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310603,
					"content": "是指在那個地下空間裡有所感悟嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310604,
					"content": "你思考了什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310605
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10310605,
					"content": "很難說清。見到浮舍，令我有重回過去的錯覺。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310606,
					"content": "…夜叉一輩子，說得好聽是驍勇善戰，說得直白些，只會做這般殺戮之事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310607,
					"content": "能在極致的戰鬥中死去，對浮舍而言，未嘗不是一件好事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310608,
					"content": "我也是如此。我已活了許久…若是能為救人而死，稱不上太壞的事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310609,
					"content": "你應該已經知道事實並非如此了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310610
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10310610,
					"content": "嗯。又或許…我這般想法，亦是一種瘋狂。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310611
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310611,
					"content": "喂，別這麼說呀…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310612,
					"content": "魈，我們有話要告訴你。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310613
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10310613,
					"content": "啊對！是阿丑要我們告訴你的哦，非常重要。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310614,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310615,
					"content": "阿丑說，他有驅鬼之能，被人拿來防鬼，可遇見一斗之後，就一直跟一斗在一塊了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310616,
					"content": "阿丑說他不懂得那麼多大道理，只是覺得大家跟誰生活在一起更快樂，就選擇與誰同行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310617,
					"content": "活在世上，或許沒有那麼多規矩。所以…他希望你也能明白，即使夜叉之力對人有害，也不代表你不能跟大家一起。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310618,
					"content": "總有人能與你並肩。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310619
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10310619,
					"content": "是啊，比如有神之眼的人，多少能抵擋住你的力量，對吧？還有還有…哎呀，反正關心你的人絕對不少！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310620,
					"content": "…哈，這些話，倒像是浮舍他們愛說的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310621,
					"content": "那幾個傢伙從前常說，等到天下太平，他們也要去過人間的生活。似乎…只有我不這麼想。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310622
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310622,
					"content": "太威儀盤中提到浮舍神貌癲狂，常以「金鵬」、「彌怒」等名號稱呼身邊人，這些都是五夜叉的名字。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310623,
					"content": "金鵬是我，彌怒是心猿大將。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310624
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310624,
					"content": "此外，還有螺卷大將·伐難，火鼠大將·應達。聽說，人們稱我們五人為「仙眾夜叉」…哈。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310625
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310625,
					"content": "浮舍與夜蘭的祖先都留在了地下，換言之，他二人臨終前所想，也應被那片空間讀取了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310626
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310626,
					"content": "夜蘭的話，句句屬實。我與她的提案都有弊端，也都沒錯。但這片空間的強大，遠在我們之上。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310627
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310627,
					"content": "沒有你們鼎力相助，我做不到這麼多事。最後關頭也是拼盡全力，才勉強能突破一瞬間…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310628
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310628,
					"content": "那也很厲害了啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310629
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310629,
					"content": "…煙緋和夜蘭說得不錯，我確實一直都做著最壞的打算。這種想法根深蒂固…卻已是我能想到最好的辦法。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310630
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310630,
					"content": "那個瞬間，如非帝君出手相助，我恐怕無法逃生。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310631
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310631,
					"content": "那股力量，果然是鍾離嗎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310632
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10310632,
					"content": "終究還是勞煩他人了啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310633
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310633,
					"content": "但很正常吧？你跟鍾離…不是，你跟岩王帝君認識這麼久，你幫過他的忙，他幫幫你也沒什麼，對吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310634,
						10310635
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310634,
					"content": "是啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310636
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10310636,
					"content": "…嗯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310637
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310637,
					"content": "逃離空間的瞬間，我隱約感受到浮舍殘留的記憶。若說此行有什麼收穫，便是這個了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310638
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310638,
					"content": "我好像也隱約感覺到了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310639
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10310639,
					"content": "…多一個人記住他，也不錯。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310640
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310640,
					"content": "#今天，我說了太多話。但與{F#妳}{M#你}交談，不需保留太多。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310641
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310641,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}可曾有一刻感知到天命？生的可能，死的來臨…無論何種。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310642
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310642,
					"content": "時至今日我已明白，天命是夜叉最能感知到的劫難。註定悲戚…但我們無懼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310643
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310643,
					"content": "…魈…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310644
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310644,
					"content": "告訴我這些，沒關係嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310645
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10310645,
					"content": "#無妨。帝君也說過{F#妳}{M#你}是見證者。人間的故事，理應道予{F#妳}{M#你}。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310646
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310646,
					"content": "伐難、彌怒與應達均已殞命，唯有浮舍下落不明。此事如木刺在心，所以明知艱險，我亦去了層岩。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310647
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310647,
					"content": "…如今總算知道了當年在層岩巨淵發生過什麼，也算了結一段往事。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310648
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310648,
					"content": "離開空間前，我取了一塊石頭。若能成功帶出來，便要以此石代浮舍，放入紀念銅雀的廟宇。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310649
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310649,
					"content": "可惜，還是留不住。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310650
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310650,
					"content": "銅雀死於千年前的魔神戰爭，他比我們都年輕，他戰死時，浮舍很難過。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310651
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310651,
					"content": "夜叉死傷太多，猶如滿天飛鳥散於各地。如伐難所說…夜叉難尋魂歸之處。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310652
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310652,
					"content": "浮舍、伯陽，還有那些將士…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310653
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310653,
					"content": "別這麼說，大家都是英雄。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310654
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10310654,
					"content": "英雄…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310655
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310655,
					"content": "…是個好詞。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310656
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310656,
					"content": "災厄或無盡頭，可凡塵有情，縱是修羅亦有牽掛。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310657
					],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310657,
					"content": "#就應{F#妳}{M#你}說的吧。從今往後，天下英雄永不陌路。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "魈"
				},
				{
					"id": 10310635,
					"content": "互相扶持才能生存下去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10310636
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}